==== BEGIN: Freebuff desktop-cloud port (desktop v1.1) ====

Source: Freebuff, https://github.com/CodebuffAI/freebuff, commit 0dc95cb,
folder common/src/desktop-cloud/. Licensed under the Apache License, Version
2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0; full text also in
ui/neuron-tui/LICENSE). Freebuff's NOTICE file reads:

    Codebuff
    Copyright 2025 Codebuff

    This product includes software developed for the Codebuff project.

Ported, and modified for Neuron (zod schemas replaced with plain types):

  project-name.ts (projectNameFromPrompt and its word lists)
      -> src/worktreeName.ts (copyNameFromPrompt); slugified into the copy's
         branch by src-tauri/src/worktree.rs (rename)
  project-name.test.ts (projectNameFromPrompt cases) -> test/worktree-name.test.ts
  pull-request.ts (PullRequestChecks, PullRequestStatus, PullRequestSnapshot,
      normalizePullRequestChecks) -> src/pullRequest.ts; the snapshot shape
      also in src-tauri/src/pr.rs
  pull-request.test.ts -> test/pull-request.test.tsx
  image-files.ts (imageMimeType) and media-files.ts (mediaType)
      -> src/mediaFiles.ts; the same type list in src-tauri/src/workspace.rs
      (preview_type)
  image-files.test.ts -> test/v11-desktop.test.tsx
  changes.ts (ChangedFile, totals) -> shapes of BranchFile and BranchChanges in
      src/platform/types.ts and src-tauri/src/git.rs
  hosted-git.ts (GitSummary: branch, base, pull request) -> the branch scope
      and the pull request chip's data flow
  hosted-workspace.ts (quit.onRequest / quit.answer) -> Platform.quit in
      src/platform/types.ts and src/platform/tauri.ts; src-tauri/src/quit.rs

Not ported: file-download.ts and parseByteRange (media is read whole, with a
size cap, not served by byte range), desktop-update.ts (the "install when
idle" update card; the desktop updater does not install yet).

==== END: Freebuff desktop-cloud port (desktop v1.1) ====
